# CR 117.3a-117.3c, ADR-0019: the active player gets priority first. human,
# the active player, passes with an empty stack; ai casts Lightning Bolt at
# human and, keeping priority, passes; human then responds with a Bolt at
# ai. The explicit "queue action human pass" is what lets human's Bolt wait
# for the second ask instead of being cast into an empty stack. Only the
# top object resolves (CR 117.4): ai goes to 0 and loses (CR 704.5a)
# before ai's own Bolt resolves.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana ai 4 R
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets human
queue targets ai
queue action human pass
queue action human cast 1
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
